{"files":{"normalize.js":"function normalize(text) {
  if (typeof text !== 'string') {
    return '';
  }
  let s = text.normalize('NFKC');
  s = s.normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g, '');
  s = s.toLowerCase();
  s = s.replace(/\s+/g, ' ').trim();
  return s;
}
"},"message":"normalize.js is ready. It applies NFKC, then NFD and removes combining marks U+0300-U+036F, lowercases, collapses whitespace to a single ASCII space, and trims. It also guards against non-string input by returning an empty string. This should give tokenizer.js a clean base to work from. Let me know if you'd like any adjustments."}
